]},{"nodeId":111020602,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10204,"speakerName":"魈","textMapHash":4067428814,"text":"さっきお前たちが言っていた、「掇星攫辰天君」とは何者だ？","nextNodeIds":[111020603]},{"nodeId":111020603,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1744068286,"text":"オイラが説明しよう！","nextNodeIds":[111020604]},{"nodeId":111020604,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10204,"speakerName":"魈","textMapHash":724739798,"text":"「願いを叶える仙人」などに騙される人がいるなんてな…","nextNodeIds":[111020605]},{"nodeId":111020605,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4069917054,"text":"仙人である魈には、願いを叶える力ってあるのか？","nextNodeIds":[111020606]},{"nodeId":111020606,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10204,"speakerName":"魈","textMapHash":2421022142,"text":"昔の璃月には、労せずして得ようとする者はいなかった。","nextNodeIds":[111020607]},{"nodeId":111020607,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10204,"speakerName":"魈","textMapHash":2800761310,"text":"数千年前の璃月の民が必要だったのは、自分たちの住む所を守る力。","nextNodeIds":[111020608]},{"nodeId":111020608,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":34550958,"text":"でも今の時代の人々にとっては、願いを叶える仙人の方がいいんじゃないか…","nextNodeIds":[111020609]},{"nodeId":111020609,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10204,"speakerName":"魈","textMapHash":2867989110,"text":"この時代がどれだけ軟弱であろうと、我とは関係ない。我は帝君の意志に従うのみ。","nextNodeIds":[111020610]},{"nodeId":111020610,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2014070230,"text":"オイラまた間違ったことを言ってしまったみたいだぜ…","nextNodeIds":[111020611]},{"nodeId":111020611,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2737637926,"text":"そ…そうだ！あの偽仙人は「禁忌滅却の札」っていう魔を退治できるものを持ってたんだ！","nextNodeIds":[111020612]},{"nodeId":111020612,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10204,"speakerName":"魈","textMapHash":2971585934,"text":"そんなもので退治を？ふん…愚かな。消さずして退治など、どうりで全てここに集まるわけだ。","nextNodeIds":[111020613]},{"nodeId":111020613,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10204,"speakerName":"魈","textMapHash":3502376222,"text":"このままでは、我の手に負えなくなる…「禁忌滅却の札」をそいつの手から回収する。","nextNodeIds":[111020614,111020615]},{"nodeId":111020614,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":484364078,"text":"「回収」だけじゃ足りないよね？","nextNodeIds":[111020616]},{"nodeId":111020616,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2458073878,"text":"やっぱりオイラの仲間だぜ！オイラもそう思ってたんだ。オイラたちを騙したあいつを懲らしめてやらないと！","nextNodeIds":[111020617]},{"nodeId":111020617,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":74828150,"text":"ちょうどこっちには正真正銘の仙人もいるしな…魈が手を出せば、もう二度と仙人を名乗れないと思うぞ！","nextNodeIds":[111020618]},{"nodeId":111020618,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10204,"speakerName":"魈","textMapHash":885765686,"text":"いや。我が討つのは妖魔のみ、人は殺さない。","nextNodeIds":[111020619]},{"nodeId":111020619,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":229394606,"text":"いや、殺すとは言ってない！","nextNodeIds":[111020620]},{"nodeId":111020620,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10204,"speakerName":"魈","textMapHash":3332419454,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[111020621]},{"nodeId":111020621,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10204,"speakerName":"魈","textMapHash":2086473142,"text":"確かにそいつが悪行をやめれば、璃月にとっても有益なことだ。","nextNodeIds":[111020622]},{"nodeId":111020622,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10204,"speakerName":"魈","textMapHash":3142807062,"text":"我に「夢遊諸境法」という術がある。本来は眠りについた魂と体を引き離すのに使うが…","nextNodeIds":[111020623]},{"nodeId":111020623,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10204,"speakerName":"魈","textMapHash":4121127286,"text":"これを応用すれば、他人の魂を呼ぶこともできる。","nextNodeIds":[111020624]},{"nodeId":111020624,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2614776310,"text":"うわっ！これが本当の仙法か！","nextNodeIds":[111020625,111020626]},{"nodeId":111020625,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":157575862,"text":"「夢枕」的な？","nextNodeIds":[111020627]},{"nodeId":111020627,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10204,"speakerName":"魈","textMapHash":2428860086,"text":"これを行うには儀式をする必要がある。悪いが…香炉を一つ、七星灯を七つ、それと温度を下げられる物を少し用意してくれないか。","nextNodeIds":[111020628]},{"nodeId":111020628,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2406728670,"text":"温度を下げられる物…霧氷花とかがいいんじゃないか？","nextNodeIds":[111020629]},{"nodeId":111020629,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3148611806,"text":"でも香炉と七星灯はそこら辺に落ちてるものじゃないよな？","nextNodeIds":[111020630]},{"nodeId":111020630,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10204,"speakerName":"魈","textMapHash":1678432222,"text":"天衡山南部の道路わきに、「夜叉石像」が二体あるのは知ってるか？","nextNodeIds":[111020631]},{"nodeId":111020631,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10204,"speakerName":"魈","textMapHash":1332526222,"text":"璃月の先住民がその近くに寺を建て、夜叉を祀っていたんだ。そこでなら祭事に使われていた物が残っているかもしれない。","nextNodeIds":[111020632]},{"nodeId":111020632,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10204,"speakerName":"魈","textMapHash":2856495462,"text":"全てが揃い夜が来たら、「夜叉石像」で我を待て。やり方を教えてやる。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":111020626,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1891540494,"text":"怯えて死んじゃうかも。","nextNodeIds":[111020627]},{"nodeId":111020615,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2741537222,"text":"教育をしないと。","nextNodeIds":[111020616]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1110206,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1102,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FAIL_DUNGEON","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[3,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_ENTER_MY_WORLD","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":[],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_UNLOCK_AVATAR_TEAM"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","173"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_LOCK_POINT"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["1032","201032007"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_NOTIFY_GROUP_LUA"}],"guide